Subject: [PATCH 7/7] fix: backup 3 bans xoay vong + atomic save

- Them backup xoay vong toi da 3 ban (.bak.1/.bak.2/.bak.3) truoc moi lan ghi
- Ghi file nguyen tu qua .tmp + ATOMIC_MOVE tranh file bi cat nua khi crash
- Tu dong khoi phuc tu backup gan nhat khi file chinh bi hong/rong, loop clean ban cuoi
- Dong bo hoa saveAll() + atomicWrite() + isCorrupted() parse JSON

---
